>Swisher</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Correa</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Failure patterns correlate with the proportion of residual carcinoma after preoperative chemoradiotherapy for carcinoma of the esophagus</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>2005</year><volume>104</volume><fpage>1349</fpage><lpage>55</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/cncr.21346</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Rohatgi PR, Swisher SG, Correa AM, et al. Failure patterns correlate with the proportion of residual carcinoma after preoperative chemoradiotherapy for carcinoma of the esophagus. Cancer 2005;104:1349&#x02013;55 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16130133</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR16"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ott</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Fink</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Becker</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Prediction of response to preoperative chemotherapy in gastric carcinoma by metabolic imaging: results of a prospective trial</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>2003</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>4604</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1200/JCO.2003.06.574</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Ott K, Fink U, Becker K, et al. Prediction of response to preoperative chemotherapy in gastric carcinoma by metabolic imaging: results of a prospective trial. J Clin Oncol 2003;21:4604&#x02013;10 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14673049</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR17"><label>17.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ajani</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ota</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Jess